# fz: PLO_LOADGANI (195) DEFAULT* lines. Each 195 names unique files; a WANTFILE/UPDATEFILE for one shows the client
# read the line. After each 195 the player is set to that gani (PLO 9 prop 10) and shot.
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 8
drop s2c 195
shot 00-base
mark D1 idle: DEFAULTHEAD fzhead1.png
